1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,250
(Howard:)What are you thinking,
maybe a big musical number?

2
00:00:06,673 --> 00:00:11,633
(Sheldon:)Well, I'm going to make some warm milk
and then turn in.

3
00:00:11,803 --> 00:00:15,303
(Sheldon:)I trust if you two are planning
on engaging in amorous activities...

4
00:00:15,474 --> 00:00:17,474
(Sheldon:)...you'll keep the decibel level
to a minimum.

5
00:00:17,976 --> 00:00:19,476
(Sheldon:)Of course.

6
00:00:19,644 --> 00:00:21,314
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

7
00:00:22,689 --> 00:00:26,739
Mm. These are so good. Mm.

8
00:00:26,902 --> 00:00:28,822
(Leonard:)Unbelievable.

9
00:00:30,155 --> 00:00:32,115
(Howard:)-What?
-I was just thinking...

10
00:00:32,282 --> 00:00:34,322
(Leonard:)...we should probably turn in too.

11
00:00:34,493 --> 00:00:35,993
(Penny:)Well, my new bed got delivered.

12
00:00:36,161 --> 00:00:38,831
If you put it together,
you can stay at my place.

13
00:00:38,997 --> 00:00:41,207
Really? That's a lot of work, and it's late.

14
00:00:41,416 --> 00:00:43,336
Yeah, but we won't have to be quiet.

15
00:00:43,502 --> 00:00:45,132
(Howard:)Let's go.

16
00:00:46,755 --> 00:00:47,795
[DOOR CLOSES]

17
00:00:47,964 --> 00:00:49,504
(Sheldon:)Interesting.

18
00:00:49,674 --> 00:00:54,554
(Sheldon:)Sex works even better than chocolate
to modify behavior.

19
00:00:56,473 --> 00:01:07,023
(Sheldon:)I wonder if anyone else
has stumbled onto that.

